[17.687, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m The backlog already answers the design questions: plan on PR, apply on\r\n"]
[18.587, "o", "  merge, and never auto-apply a plan that contains destroys — a delete\r\n"]
[19.387, "o", "  stops the job and waits for a human. Weakest blast radius first.\r\n"]
