[46.264, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Yes — but the gate is CI at PR time no matter what: controllers only\r\n"]
[47.164, "o", "  ever see main. GitOps never replaces the PR half; it only changes who\r\n"]
[47.964, "o", "  holds the apply credentials.\r\n"]
