[61.323, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m For the tofu repos: essentially none — their APIs are public. For the\r\n"]
[62.223, "o", "  cluster it's concrete: a hosted runner can't reach the k3s API at all,\r\n"]
[63.023, "o", "  and a controller that pulls means no kubeconfig ever leaves the lab.\r\n"]
